 font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" font-style=\"italic\">Procedure related:</tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"43.2\" y=\"33.95\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">Half of cord prolapse (are </tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"1\" x=\"43.2\" y=\"47.9\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">procedure related)</tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"25.2\" y=\"69.85\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">1.  ARM with high presenting part</tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"25.2\" y=\"90.8\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">2.  Vaginal manipulation with </tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"1\" x=\"43.2\" y=\"103.75\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">ruptured membranes</tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"43.2\" y=\"124.7\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">Avoid upward pushing</tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"25.2\" y=\"146.65\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">3. ECV</tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"25.2\" y=\"167.6\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">4. Stabilizing induction</tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"25.2\" y=\"188.55\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">5. Insertion of I/U Catheter </tspan></text></g><g transform=\"scale(12700)\"><text data-mm-wrapped-line=\"0\" x=\"43.2\" y=\"209.5\" text-anchor=\"start\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><tspan font-size=\"12\">Esp if filled more than 180ml.</tspan></text></g></g></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"553ce6934f0a6fd315cc\" transform=\"translate(741680 56515)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(2225040 7620) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(-2225040 -7620)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 4450080 15240\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"6b1e1b4404a33039b983\" transform=\"translate(741680 71755)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 5080 284480\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-6b1e1b4404a33039b983)\"></path></g></g><g data-mm-object-id=\"7ad02f76d1597a700f64\" transform=\"translate(5191760 56515)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 5080 284480\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-7ad02f76d1597a700f64)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21893]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>General</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21894]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Multiparty</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21895]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>LBW &lt; 2.5kg</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21896]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>PTL &lt; 37weeks</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21897]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>4. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Congenital anomalies</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21898]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Breech</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21899]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>6. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Transverse lie</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21900]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Unstable lie \u2013 lie changes repeatedly</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21901]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Oblique</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> lie after 37 weeks</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"2d9d7a446f3bf8538d9d1886\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-10-035\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 2d9d7a446f3bf8538d9d1886\" viewbox=\"1952625 -9525 200025 276225\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"03471129bac0a8242b68b304599200a2fbadefc4e52dfc2a265817291f56bf4a\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"276e62815148d1bc95e0\" transform=\"translate(1986280 5080)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 147320 L 30480 147320 L 30480 0 L 91440 0 L 91440 147320 L 121920 147320 L 60960 208280 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" fill-opacity=\"1\" stroke=\"#5B9BD5\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21903]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Admit + Stabilizing induction</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21904]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>7. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>2</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>nd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> twin \u2013 treatment IPV + Breech extraction</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21905]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>8. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Polyhydramnios</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21906]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>9. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Un \u2013 engaged fetal head</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21907]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>10. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Low lying placenta</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21908]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Cord presentation:</strong></u></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21909]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>USG only in research setting</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21910]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Consider USG in Breech @ term who want vaginal Breech delivery</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21911]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>C/S is recommended in cord presentation</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21912]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Cord prolapse @ margin of viability</strong></u></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21913]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">309.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Expectant management</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21914]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">310.</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Counselling regarding continuation/ TOP.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21915]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21916]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[21917]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 72pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word